# This is a PRIVATE repo. Conversation transcripts in data/ grow without bound
# (a single session can exceed GitHub's 100MB per-file limit), so data/ is NOT
# tracked — it's local runtime state, read by the app from disk. Greeting audio
# stays committed.
# Transient build/OS junk (regenerates; not content) is also ignored:
data/
*.log
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
dist-windows/
build/
dist/
*.spec

# iOS app (ios/): generated project + per-machine signing
ios/MIST.xcodeproj/
ios/Config/Signing.xcconfig
